:: adidas-neck {"position": "300,400", "size": "100,100"}
<div class="passage-content">
Can you see the Adidas logo through the neck?

The Adidas logo should be a patch on the back of the jersey. It should not be visible through the neck or embroidered directly to the jersey.
The exception to this is the 2016 World Cup of Hockey jerseys.
</div>

<div class="passage-actions">
(link: "❌ Yes")[(set: $flags to $flags + 1)(set: $flagnames to $flagnames + (a: "Adidas logo visible inside neck"))(go-to: "band")]
|fakeANeck1>[ <img src="images/inside-fake.png" alt="Fake jersey interior (neck area)"> ](click: ?fakeANeck1)[(set: $flags to $flags + 1)(set: $flagnames to $flagnames + (a: "Adidas logo visible inside neck"))(go-to: "band")]

[[ ✅ No ->band]]
|imgLink1>[ <img src="images/inside-legit.png" alt="Legit jersey interior (neck area)"> ](click: ?imgLink1)[(go-to: "band")]

(link: "🤔 I'm not sure")[(set: $unsure to $unsure + 1)(set: $unsurenames to $unsurenames + (a: "Inside neck check"))(go-to: "band")]
</div>
